-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

LogicBBS features an option for the sysop to give temporary free download to
users on his system, for a period of time.

From bbs menu prompt, the key assigned is "#".
From an offline node press [F8]

You can edit or view users.



-----------------
Editing accounts.

When editing an account, you will be asked for:

[DATE]  Enter expiration date of users free download account.

[AMOUNT] Enter sum of payment. This is merely for your personal use.
         So sysop can keep track of payments.

Users current Download bytes/files will be saved, and restored when
his free download account expires.



-----------------
Viewing accounts.

Sysop will be shown:
DAYS LEFT:   Until freedown account will be removed.
DOWNLOADS:   Both bytes & files downloaded since his FDA was created,
             can be viewed.

PAID     :   Payment made
ENDDATE  :   Expiration date of account.



User will be notified about his download byte/file ratio being returned to
normal state. And if sysop made a textfile called 'DisabledEnd'[.TXT] (Pri.2)
Textfile will be shown to user.

All the sysop needs to do, is update accounts if any information changes.
In other cases the system, will keep track of users account, and "kindly"
remove the disabled ratio(s) when the day comes.
